/**
 * The curated icon set (design-system.md §2): our name for an icon's *meaning* → the Lucide glyph
 * drawn for it. Zones never import from `lucide-react`; `pnpm icons` turns this map into
 * `glyphs/<name>.ts` (one plain-data module per icon) and `registry.ts` (stories and tests only).
 *
 * Add a key when a screen first needs an icon, run `pnpm icons`, import `Icon<Name>` from
 * `@/ui/icons/glyphs/<name>`. `pnpm icons:check` (CI) fails when the generated files are stale.
 */
